    <briefdescription>
<para>Type traits, template constraints, and compile-time metaprogramming utilities. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Encapsulating the <computeroutput>gl::traits</computeroutput> namespace, these components form the strict conceptual backbone of the library. They are used extensively to constrain template parameters, safely query type properties at compile time, and ensure that user-provided graphs and property maps meet required structural and behavioral contracts.</para>
